Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "rol_id": "cliente",
    "nombre": "Sofía",
    "apellidos": "Brenes",
    "email": "otra@correo.com",
    "password": "Sofia2026*"
}

### Insertar con varios campos inválidos a la vez (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "rol_id": 0,
    "nombre": "",
    "apellidos": "B",
    "email": "x",
    "password": "123"
}

### Insertar con email repetido (409 desde datos)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "rol_id": 3,
    "nombre": "Laura",
    "apellidos": "Mora",
    "email": "laura@correo.com",
    "password": "Laura2026*"
}

### Actualizar teléfono
PUT {{uri}}/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "telefono": "8999-0000"
}

